WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.350
Before judging AI, ask what the learner wants to achieve and what the result shows.

2
00:00:06.277 --> 00:00:10.927
A finished product can be valuable without proving that a new skill was learned.

3
00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:16.230
Learning goals, available tools and evidence all affect our judgement.

4
00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:21.234
The question stays open. Our reasons can become more precise.
